{"question_id": "FS-a5ec8a989adf8327", "question_type": "subjective", "original_digest": "db62f5ba39766511fd0cb826a3d2124cd81ebf608227b51fce2fcf2e3797ba38", "formula_status": "formula_manual_review", "normalized": {"id": "FS-a5ec8a989adf8327", "stem": "11.(13分)(2025·南昌模拟)已知函数$f(x)=\\log_{3}(9^{x}+1)+kx$是偶函数.\n(1)求k的值；(6分)\n(2)解不等式$f(x)\\geq \\log_{3}(7·3^{x}-1).(7$分)", "options": null, "answer": null, "explanation": "(1)∵f(x)是偶函数，\n∴f(-x)=f(x)，\n即log_(3)(9^(-x)+1)-kx=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)+kx对任意x∈R恒成立，\n∴2kx=log_(3)(9^(-x)+1)-log_(3)(9^(x)+1)\n=log_(3)(9^(−x)+1)/(9^(x)+1)=log_(3)3^(-2x)=-2x，\n∴k=-1.\n(2)由(1)得f(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-x=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-log_(3)3^(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)/(3^(x))=log_(3)(3^(x)+3^(-x))，\n则不等式f(x)≥log_(3)(7·3^(x)-1)等价于3^(x)+3^(-x)≥7·3^(x)-1>0，\n由7·3^(x)-1>0，解得x>-log_(3)7；\n由3^(x)+3^(-x)≥7·3^(x)-1，\n得6·(3^(x))^(2)-3^(x)-1≤0，\n得0<3^(x)≤(1)/(2)，\n即x≤-log_(3)2，\n综上，不等式的解集为{x|-log_(3)7<x≤-log_(3)2}.", "difficulty": 2, "estimated_time": 360, "question_type": "subjective", "knowledge_point_id": "K005", "knowledge_point_name": "函数奇偶性", "source_type": "docx", "source_fingerprint": "cec9fff15dd9d4e4a654249aa3232ace1057f6c53367d64ae3e2514feeb98c77", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.7　对数与对数函数.docx", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 279–295", "answer_expression": null, "accepted_answers": null, "answer_type": null, "reference_answer": "(1)∵f(x)是偶函数，\n∴f(-x)=f(x)，\n即log_(3)(9^(-x)+1)-kx=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)+kx对任意x∈R恒成立，\n∴2kx=log_(3)(9^(-x)+1)-log_(3)(9^(x)+1)\n=log_(3)(9^(−x)+1)/(9^(x)+1)=log_(3)3^(-2x)=-2x，\n∴k=-1.\n(2)由(1)得f(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-x=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-log_(3)3^(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)/(3^(x))=log_(3)(3^(x)+3^(-x))，\n则不等式f(x)≥log_(3)(7·3^(x)-1)等价于3^(x)+3^(-x)≥7·3^(x)-1>0，\n由7·3^(x)-1>0，解得x>-log_(3)7；\n由3^(x)+3^(-x)≥7·3^(x)-1，\n得6·(3^(x))^(2)-3^(x)-1≤0，\n得0<3^(x)≤(1)/(2)，\n即x≤-log_(3)2，\n综上，不等式的解集为{x|-log_(3)7<x≤-log_(3)2}.", "solution_steps": ["(1)∵f(x)是偶函数，", "∴$f(-x)=f(x),$", "即$\\log_{3}(9^{-x}+1)-kx=\\log_{3}(9^{x}+1)+kx$对任意$x\\in R$恒成立，", "∴$2kx=\\log_{3}(9^{-x}+1)-\\log_{3}(9^{x}+1)$", "=log_(3)(9^(−x)+1)/(9^(x)+1)=log_(3)3^(-2x)=-2x，", "∴$k=-1.$", "(2)由(1)得f(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-x=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-log_(3)3^(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)/(3^(x))=log_(3)(3^(x)+3^(-x))，", "则不等式$f(x)\\geq \\log_{3}(7·3^{x}-1)$等价于$3^{x}+3^{-x}\\geq 7·3^{x}-1>0,$", "由$7·3^{x}-1>0,$解得$x>-\\log_{3} 7$；", "由$3^{x}+3^{-x}\\geq 7·3^{x}-1,$", "得$6·(3^{x})^{2}-3^{x}-1\\leq 0,$", "得$0<3^{x}\\leq \\frac{1}{2},$", "即$x\\leq -\\log_{3} 2,$", "综上，不等式的解集为$\\{x|-\\log_{3} 7<x\\leq -\\log_{3} 2\\}.$"], "rubric": [{"criterion": "第1问：求k的值", "score": 6, "sub_question": "1"}, {"criterion": "第2问：解不等式$f(x)\\geq \\log_{3}(7·3^{x}-1)$", "score": 7, "sub_question": "2"}], "max_score": 13.0, "sub_questions": [{"id": "1", "stem": "求k的值；(6分)", "max_score": 6}, {"id": "2", "stem": "解不等式$f(x)\\geq \\log_{3}(7·3^{x}-1).(7$分)", "max_score": 7}], "rubric_source": "derived_for_system", "reference_answers_by_subquestion": {"1": "∵f(x)是偶函数，\n∴f(-x)=f(x)，\n即log_(3)(9^(-x)+1)-kx=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)+kx对任意x∈R恒成立，\n∴2kx=log_(3)(9^(-x)+1)-log_(3)(9^(x)+1)\n=log_(3)(9^(−x)+1)/(9^(x)+1)=log_(3)3^(-2x)=-2x，\n∴k=-1.", "2": "由(1)得f(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-x=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-log_(3)3^(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)/(3^(x))=log_(3)(3^(x)+3^(-x))，\n则不等式f(x)≥log_(3)(7·3^(x)-1)等价于3^(x)+3^(-x)≥7·3^(x)-1>0，\n由7·3^(x)-1>0，解得x>-log_(3)7；\n由3^(x)+3^(-x)≥7·3^(x)-1，\n得6·(3^(x))^(2)-3^(x)-1≤0，\n得0<3^(x)≤(1)/(2)，\n即x≤-log_(3)2，\n综上，不等式的解集为{x|-log_(3)7<x≤-log_(3)2}."}, "formula_status": "unverified"}, "changes": [{"field": "stem", "original": "11.(13分)(2025·南昌模拟)已知函数f(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)+kx是偶函数.\n(1)求k的值；(6分)\n(2)解不等式f(x)≥log_(3)(7·3^(x)-1).(7分)", "normalized": "11.(13分)(2025·南昌模拟)已知函数$f(x)=\\log_{3}(9^{x}+1)+kx$是偶函数.\n(1)求k的值；(6分)\n(2)解不等式$f(x)\\geq \\log_{3}(7·3^{x}-1).(7$分)", "issue": "legacy_notation", "safe": true}, {"field": "solution_steps[1]", "original": "∴f(-x)=f(x)，", "normalized": "∴$f(-x)=f(x),$", "issue": "legacy_notation", "safe": true}, {"field": "solution_steps[2]", "original"